# Restriction checkboxes for TSX_GridColumns_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# Support code for the Columns list of every React grid; it does not depend on a table. The menu offers it on the database, the CLI runs it without -t.
Scope=Database
# No OutputName: the template writes its own paths (components/gridColumns.tsx and its test) with @@@FILE markers.
# Whole-project generation (codegen generate): the stacks that include this template, the tables it runs for and where its files go.
Stacks=React
OutputFolder=src
